// +groupName supplies the API group to controller-gen. controller-gen does not
// read the GroupVersion var below — it is Go, not a marker — so without this
// line `controller-gen crd` emits a CRD with an empty spec.group and a
// malformed metadata.name ("<plurals>."), which the API server rejects.
//
// +groupName={{.Group}}
// +kubebuilder:object:generate=true
